<section class="frame review-intro"><span class="micro">Round 02 / Positioning before polish</span><h1>A site built around<br />the equipment people have.</h1><p>Cottage systems grow piece by piece. These three directions test how Origin89 can make mixed equipment easier to manage, with local control and an open stack underneath.</p></section>
<section class="frame study-options">
<article class="study-option"><a class="option-visual" href="/next/equipment-first/" aria-label="Explore direction A: Equipment first"><img class="mini-logo" src={art.logoBlue} alt="" /><h2>Make your<br />equipment<br /><span class="ink">work together.</span></h2><img class="option-controller" src={art.controller} alt=""/><span class="mini-label">HARDWARE · FIRMWARE · APPS</span></a><div class="option-description"><span class="micro recommended-label">A / Equipment first · Recommended</span><h3>Keep the useful equipment.</h3><p>Lead with a setup built over time and on a budget. Make model search the first step, then show how the system fits.</p><a class="text-action" href="/next/equipment-first/">Explore direction A ↗</a></div></article>
<article class="study-option"><a class="option-visual" href="/next/site-first/" aria-label="Explore direction B: Site first"><img class="mini-logo" src={art.logoWhite} alt=""/><h2>Know your site<br />before you go.</h2><div class="mini-console"><div><span>BATTERY</span><strong>78%</strong></div><div><span>SOLAR</span><strong>2.4</strong></div><div><span>INSIDE</span><strong>18.4°</strong></div></div></a><div class="option-description"><span class="micro">B / Site first</span><h3>See the practical payoff.</h3><p>Lead with the owner’s next visit and a large site overview. A useful view gives the product an immediate purpose.</p><a class="text-action" href="/next/site-first/">Explore direction B ↗</a></div></article>
<article class="study-option"><a class="option-visual" href="/next/ownership-first/" aria-label="Explore direction C: Ownership first"><img class="mini-logo" src={art.logoWhite} alt=""/><h2>Own the system<br />your site<br />depends on.</h2><img class="option-controller" src={art.board} alt=""/><span class="mini-label">OPEN FROM THE BOARD UP</span></a><div class="option-description"><span class="micro">C / Ownership first</span><h3>Make ownership tangible.</h3><p>Lead with the hardware and the ability to understand, adapt and maintain the system. Strongest for technical owners.</p><a class="text-action" href="/next/ownership-first/">Explore direction C ↗</a></div></article>
